<!--
    THIS IS A BETA BRANCH (beta/v1.1-road-ice, created 2026-09-28) — see
    CLAUDE.md "Garmin watch apps: beta lives in the personal repo, production
    in Tallimedia's". This branch and this id live on `origin` only. Never
    push it to the `tallimedia` remote, never merge it into `main`.

    The public store entry (1.0.0, 2026-09-21) uses id
    0f3b51991291466bb7f5a57a0b689537 on `main` — untouched here.

    This beta's id, 8a6b649545ae422aa7d00cc7fa6263b4, was generated fresh for
    v1.1 testing (`uuidgen | tr -d - | tr 'A-Z' 'a-z'`), per Nico's decision
    2026-09-24 that a beta is a standing test channel now, not deleted after
    launch — so this one is expected to still exist for v1.2/v1.3 testing
    too, not just v1.1.

    Watch out: Application.Storage and app settings are keyed per app id, so
    this build starts from the shipped defaults — Helsinki and Harmaja — and
    needs its own place/station set on the watch. There is no pairing to
    redo, since the app has no account.
-->
